# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MeshSight — repository ignores
#
# Rule of thumb: code and docs go to git, DATA AND WEIGHTS NEVER DO.
#
# Android XML resources (layouts, drawables) MUST be committed, so no
# blanket *.xml here — datasets are ignored by path (data/) and by
# archive/extension patterns instead.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Datasets & local data (stay on your machine) ─────────────────────
data/**
!data/README.md

# ── Archives: dataset packs and backups never belong in git ──────────
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# ── Model weights & training artifacts ───────────────────────────────
*.tflite
*.pt
*.onnx
*.h5
*.keras
*.engine
runs/
wandb/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Android / Gradle build outputs ───────────────────────────────────
*.iml
.gradle/
local.properties
.idea/
build/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Secrets safety net ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.env
*.key
*.pem
serviceAccount*.json
